    "Category": "Dynamic Programming",
    "Front": "**Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock with Transaction Fee**\nYou may complete as many transactions as you like but pay a fee for each transaction. Return the maximum profit.\n\nExample:\nInput: prices = [1,3,2,8,4,9], fee = 2\nOutput: 8",
    "Back": "Track two states: hold (after buy), and cash (after sell). Update each state for each price.\n\n```python\nclass Solution:\n    def maxProfit(self, prices, fee):\n        cash, hold = 0, -prices[0]\n        for price in prices[1:]:\n            cash = max(cash, hold + price - fee)\n            hold = max(hold, cash - price)\n        return cash\n```"
